  "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>新增了方塊的模型與程式碼；未新增任何紋理。模組會從相關來源方塊提取紋理，亦可透過一般資源包進行覆蓋。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>與所有資源包相容。</strong></span></p>\n<p>**Minecraft 1.19.4 以上版本基於 Forge 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flib**\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flib**</a> 構建</p>\n<p>**所有 ABD 柵欄皆相容於 Diagonal Fences：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences**\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences**</a></p>\n<p>詳情請參閱圖片。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/239/791/fence1.png\" alt=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/239/791/fence1.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/239/792/stairslab1.png\" alt=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/239/792/stairslab1.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/239/788/wall1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/239/793/concrete.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fabsent-by-design\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-1bd96a?style=flat-square&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fallmylinks.com%252flothrazar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/more-links-ff69b4.svg\" alt=\"links\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Lothrazar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Patreon-Support-orange.svg?logo=Patreon\" alt=\"Support\"></a></p>",
